WEBVTT

00:01.000 --> 00:02.200
Matthew 17

00:02.200 --> 00:07.960
And after six days Jesus took with him Peter and James and John his brother,

00:08.180 --> 00:10.960
and led them up a high mountain by themselves.

00:11.460 --> 00:14.280
And he was transfigured before them,

00:14.640 --> 00:19.320
and his face shone like the sun, and his clothes became white as light.

00:19.820 --> 00:24.380
And behold, there appeared to them Moses and Elijah talking with him.

00:24.800 --> 00:26.340
And Peter said to Jesus,

00:26.900 --> 00:29.240
Lord, it is good that we are here.

00:29.240 --> 00:32.080
If you wish, I will make three tents here,

00:32.300 --> 00:36.040
one for you, one for Moses, and one for Elijah.

00:36.880 --> 00:41.380
He was still speaking when, behold, a bright cloud overshadowed them,

00:41.600 --> 00:43.460
and a voice from the cloud said,

00:44.140 --> 00:49.100
This is my beloved Son, with whom I am well pleased.

00:49.760 --> 00:50.880
Listen to him.

00:51.920 --> 00:55.380
When the disciples heard this, they fell on their faces and were terrified.

00:55.760 --> 00:58.060
But Jesus came and touched them, saying,

00:58.060 --> 01:01.100
Rise, and have no fear.

01:01.900 --> 01:06.340
And when they lifted up their eyes, they saw no one but Jesus only.

01:06.980 --> 01:10.820
And as they were coming down the mountain, Jesus commanded them,

01:11.560 --> 01:15.400
Tell no one the vision until the Son of Man is raised from the dead.

01:16.140 --> 01:17.800
And the disciples asked him,

01:18.500 --> 01:21.880
Then why do the scribes say that first Elijah must come?

01:22.320 --> 01:23.180
He answered,

01:23.740 --> 01:26.620
Elijah does come, and he will restore all things.

01:26.620 --> 01:27.880
But I tell you,

01:27.880 --> 01:31.020
I tell you that Elijah has already come, and they did not recognize him,

01:31.360 --> 01:33.080
but did to him whatever they pleased.

01:33.920 --> 01:37.460
So also the Son of Man will certainly suffer at their hands.

01:38.140 --> 01:42.540
Then the disciples understood that he was speaking to them of John the Baptist.

01:43.660 --> 01:48.480
And when they came to the crowd, a man came up to him and, kneeling before him, said,

01:48.760 --> 01:55.120
Lord, have mercy on my son, for he is an epileptic, and he suffers terribly,

01:55.120 --> 01:57.720
for often he falls into the fire.

01:57.880 --> 01:59.880
And often into the water.

01:59.880 --> 02:03.880
And I brought him to your disciples, and they could not heal him.

02:04.580 --> 02:05.880
And Jesus answered,

02:06.560 --> 02:09.560
O faithless and twisted generation,

02:09.560 --> 02:11.560
how long am I to be with you?

02:11.560 --> 02:14.560
How long am I to bear with you?

02:14.560 --> 02:16.560
Bring him here to me.

02:16.560 --> 02:18.560
And Jesus rebuked the demon,

02:18.560 --> 02:22.060
and it came out of him, and the boy was healed instantly.

02:22.060 --> 02:25.600
Then the disciples came to Jesus privately and said,

02:25.600 --> 02:27.600
Why could we not cast it out?

02:27.600 --> 02:29.600
He said to them,

02:29.600 --> 02:31.600
Because of your little faith.

02:31.600 --> 02:33.600
For truly I say to you,

02:33.600 --> 02:35.600
if you have faith like a grain of mustard seed,

02:35.600 --> 02:37.600
you will say to this mountain,

02:37.600 --> 02:39.600
Move from here to there,

02:39.600 --> 02:41.600
and it will move,

02:41.600 --> 02:43.600
and nothing will be impossible for you.

02:43.600 --> 02:45.600
As they were gathering in Galilee,

02:45.600 --> 02:47.600
Jesus said to them,

02:47.600 --> 02:51.600
The Son of Man is about to be delivered into the hands of men,

02:51.600 --> 02:53.600
and they will kill him,

02:53.600 --> 02:56.600
and he will be raised on the third day.

02:56.600 --> 02:59.600
And they were greatly distressed.

02:59.600 --> 03:01.600
When they came to Capernaum,

03:01.600 --> 03:05.600
the collectors of the two drachma tax went up to Peter and said,

03:05.600 --> 03:08.600
Does your teacher not pay the tax?

03:08.600 --> 03:09.600
He said,

03:09.600 --> 03:10.600
Yes.

03:10.600 --> 03:12.600
And when he came into the house,

03:12.600 --> 03:14.600
Jesus spoke to him first, saying,

03:14.600 --> 03:16.600
What do you think, Simon?

03:16.600 --> 03:20.600
From whom do kings of the earth take toll or tax,

03:20.600 --> 03:22.600
from their sons or from others?

03:22.600 --> 03:24.600
And when he said,

03:24.600 --> 03:26.600
From others?

03:26.600 --> 03:28.600
Jesus said to him,

03:28.600 --> 03:30.600
Then the sons are free.

03:30.600 --> 03:33.600
However, not to give offense to them,

03:33.600 --> 03:35.600
go to the sea and cast a hook

03:35.600 --> 03:37.600
and take the first fish that comes up,

03:37.600 --> 03:39.600
and when you open its mouth,

03:39.600 --> 03:41.600
you will find a shekel.

03:41.600 --> 03:45.600
Take that and give it to them for me and for yourself.

